Follow `AGENTS.md` for Assignment 2 guardrails.

For every meaningful change:

1. Explain in chat (what, why, alternatives, risks, assignment fit, report impact).
2. Update the submission notebook under `/notebook/` (`assign2-ms7556.ipynb`).
3. Re-run in Colab and sync the notebook text and report to the new outputs.

The `.ipynb` is the technical deliverable. `Assignment2.pdf` is the authoritative spec.

Never invent results. Never use `duration`, fit preprocessing outside the training rows, or touch the test set before both models are selected by validation AP. Prefer small, justified notebook edits; keep the notebook submission-ready (no checkpoint/meta clutter). Verify with real outputs.

Details on experiments, metrics, leakage, decisions, final results, report rules, and rubric are in `AGENTS.md`.
